EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Arizona State University cannot consider your application for a different semester. Therefore, please withdraw your application to ASU and reapply for the semester in which you want to attend the university.
To cancel your application, please visit https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions or email decline@ASU.edu.
In the email, please include your full name, date of birth, and the semester from which you wish to withdraw your application. Once your application is withdrawn, you can reapply to ASU for the semester you want to enroll in classes.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
